Third-party material
--------------------

* Figures reproduced in manuscripts/notes/ and manuscripts/talk/figs/ (files
  CodeReduceTokens.png, ConvCurve3.png, FullComputeGraphs2.png, In200Out4.png,
  Motivation1.png, QChipCompare1.png, ScalableOpt2.png, Statistics2.png,
  optVariantsW.png) are taken from B. Rosenhahn, T. J. Osborne and C. Hirche,
  "Optimization driven quantum circuit reduction", New J. Phys. 27, 104509
  (2025), published under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 licence
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). They are unmodified.

* qcr/compute_graph.py, qcr/reducer.py and qcr/rf.py are an independent Python
  re-implementation of the method described in that paper, written by following
  the authors' MATLAB demo (QCOptimDemo). No MATLAB code is redistributed here;
  tools/fetch_external.sh downloads it from the authors' web page.

* Benchmark circuits (inQWIRE/VOQC-benchmarks, pnnl/QASMBench) are not
  redistributed; they remain under their own licences. tools/fetch_external.sh
  clones them at pinned commits into external/benchmarks/.
